<title>INDIA: India Kothari Pioneer MMMF yield at 10.84 percent.</title>
<headline>India Kothari Pioneer MMMF yield at 10.84 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kothari Pioneer Mutual Fund said on Monday rate on its money market mutual fund (MMMF) yield as on July 28 was 10.84 percent.</p>
<p>Kothari Pioneer Mutual Fund is a joint venture between India's Kothari Group and U.S. mutual fund Pioneer Inc.</p>
<p>	  The following are the Net Asset Value (NAV) for Kothari</p>
<p>Pioneer's other mutual funds.</p>
<p>-------</p>
<p>    Name of Fund				NAV(Rs.per share)</p>
<p>    ------------				-----------------</p>
<p>    Prima fund					 10.29</p>
<p>    Prima plus					  7.97</p>
<p>    Bluechip fund				    13.77</p>
<p>    Taxshield	95				 8.59</p>
<p>			 96				12.62</p>
<p>			 97				12.32</p>
<p>    Pension plan				     10.55</p>
<p>    Guaranted Income Plan - Annual	     10.94</p>
<p>				    Monthly	    10.44 .</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
